        <Text style={{ fontSize: 56, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B', lineHeight: 1.15 }}>记住三件事</Text>

        <Box style={{ width: 72, height: 4, background: '#276FBF', marginBottom: 6 }} />

        <Box style={{ width: 1152, height: 100, background: '#EDF4FC', borderRadius: 10, padding: '0 22px', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 18 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#276FBF' }}>三层分开报</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#546779', flex: 1 }}>执行状态、行为质量、业务成效可以互相解释，不能互相替代；未执行就是未执行。</Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 566, height: 100, background: '#FFF4E6', borderRadius: 10, padding: '0 22px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#CB6B28' }}>指标先定口径</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#546779' }}>分母、窗口与获知证据在运行前固定，事后不补。</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 566, height: 100, background: '#ECF7F2', borderRadius: 10, padding: '0 22px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#26816B' }}>对照说明改动</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#546779' }}>保留基线，只改变一处；仿真观察推不到真实社区。</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#546779', marginTop: 8 }}>下一节：导出、迁移与离线回放 —— 区分资源包、实验包、Run 包与结果 ZIP</Text>

    </Box>

</Slide>
